      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To be Honest i agree because if the instance master or world creator can't see who started a votekick then what's the point of adding it to the game it really doesn't make sense it would make a lot more sense if the instance master or world creator can see who started a votekick if not then what's the point of adding the votekick to the game?",
