  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "too many times in my own worlds do i have to stop what im doing to try and figure out who's making a votekick against a person and why, and i can never get a straight answer, this makes world moderation VERY HARD and often sometimes impossible,\nI think the instance master and the world creator should be able to see who initiated the votekick, as this was originally visible to everyone in the past and was then restricted.",
